' @test valid
' @role test
' @status stable
' @dialect en-standard
' @covers Op.Think, Mod.Result
' @description THINK with RESULT and anonymous body coexisting (D-0032)

RECEIVE request
END

THINK verdict
  RESULT
  * category: CHOICE(bug, feature, question) - request type
  <<
  Classify this request: $request
  >>
END

WAIT
  ON ?verdict
END

EXIT
